We built an MCP server that connects AI agents like Claude, Cursor, Codex to our Airbnb/STR analytics database.<p>one command to set up:
claude mcp add --transport http airroi <a href="https://mcp.airroi.com" rel="nofollow">https://mcp.airroi.com</a> --header &quot;X-API-KEY:your-key&quot;<p>Then start asking questions like:<p>- &quot;What's the average revenue for 2BRs in Miami?&quot;
- &quot;What are the top 10 best performing markets across Europe for investment?&quot;
- &quot;Are co-hosted properties outperforming single-host in my area?&quot;
- &quot;What are the comp sets for my listing 123456789, and how are they priced for the next 3 months?&quot;<p>20 tools, 20M+ properties, 190+ countries, 15 years of historical data. The AI chains tools automatically — a single question can trigger market discovery, comp analysis, and revenue forecasting etc.<p>Where it gets really powerful is agentic workflows: revenue management, automated reporting, portfolio monitoring. And since it's part of your agent's tool chain, you can plug in your own proprietary data alongside it to expand the scope even further.<p>Happy to answer questions or hear any feedback.

